WEBVTT

00:08.040 --> 00:10.940
Fall in love, boys and girls

00:11.230 --> 00:14.200
Twinkle! Put a star in your eye

00:14.870 --> 00:17.900
The passion, the way it was born

00:18.410 --> 00:21.280
Makes sparks in the jungle! Haré+Guu!

00:22.010 --> 00:25.070
How the hips shake, mucho dizzying

00:25.620 --> 00:28.610
Amigo, that's risky for a kid

00:29.190 --> 00:32.310
If I were to kiss, I'd get sucked in

00:32.890 --> 00:35.360
Tonight, I want to see something scary

00:36.490 --> 00:38.330
Don't be afraid

00:38.330 --> 00:40.130
Going from one push after another

00:40.130 --> 00:41.930
The surprising feeling is nice

00:41.930 --> 00:43.520
And you end up dancing till morning

00:44.070 --> 00:45.640
LOVE LOVE LOVE

00:45.640 --> 00:48.900
TROPICANA

00:50.870 --> 00:53.810
Catch me in the shade under the palm tree

00:54.540 --> 00:57.570
Make me wait, more than down to the limit

00:58.220 --> 01:01.210
I'm sorry, but you're already addicted

01:01.820 --> 01:04.840
From the jungle you can't escape! Haré+Guu!

01:05.460 --> 01:08.320
Fall in love, boys and girls

01:08.930 --> 01:11.920
Twinkle! Put a star in your eye

01:12.660 --> 01:15.500
The passion, the way it was born

01:16.070 --> 01:18.530
Makes sparks in the jungle! Haré+Guu!

01:30.890 --> 01:33.720
FESTIVAL BOOM BOOM

01:34.230 --> 01:36.820
And so, that's it for class today.

01:36.930 --> 01:38.090
Hurray!

01:38.200 --> 01:41.400
About the festival tonight,
don't party too hard.

01:41.400 --> 01:43.330
You have class again tomorrow.

01:43.470 --> 01:44.370
Okay!

01:44.470 --> 01:46.730
So, I'm going to take a nap until tonight.

01:50.580 --> 01:53.050
Hey, Haré. I made a yukata.

01:53.050 --> 01:53.910
See?

01:54.010 --> 01:56.040
Wow, you're amazing, Marie.

01:56.220 --> 01:58.050
When you talk about a festival,
you have to wear a yukata!

01:58.320 --> 01:59.610
What are you talking about?

01:59.690 --> 02:01.620
When you talk about a festival,
it's definitely the food booths!

02:01.950 --> 02:04.550
Baked pokutes, fried bean-potatoes,
chocolate-covered bananas...

02:04.720 --> 02:06.060
I'm so looking forward to it!

02:07.130 --> 02:09.900
Toposte, you're all about food!

02:09.900 --> 02:11.090
You're so easy to understand!

02:11.330 --> 02:12.890
I would have to say it's the shooting gallery!

02:13.000 --> 02:16.060
Festival day is about the only day that I can
shoot an anti-tank missile!

02:16.340 --> 02:18.900
Now, I need to go home soon and get the
manda candy ready.

02:18.970 --> 02:20.460
Gramps said that he's going to open a booth.

02:20.910 --> 02:23.140
Hey guys, is everything prepared?

02:23.310 --> 02:24.300
Leave it to us!

02:24.510 --> 02:25.640
All ready!

02:26.280 --> 02:27.580
Then, I'll see you at the town square!

02:27.580 --> 02:28.670
Yeah,  see you later!

02:31.820 --> 02:32.680
Ouch!

02:34.990 --> 02:36.890
That hurt! What are you doing there?

02:40.290 --> 02:41.390
What are you doing?

02:41.460 --> 02:42.520
You're so noisy.

02:42.600 --> 02:44.000
I was just talking normally!

02:44.000 --> 02:45.160
Are you telling me not to talk?

02:45.230 --> 02:45.600
Yeah.

02:46.400 --> 02:47.200
Hey, hey...

02:47.500 --> 02:48.690
Doctor Clive!

02:48.770 --> 02:50.360
Are you coming to the festival?

02:50.640 --> 02:51.530
Festival?

02:51.670 --> 02:53.000
There's one at the town square tonight.

02:53.070 --> 02:53.900
I see.

02:54.010 --> 02:55.510
When you talk about a festival...

02:55.510 --> 02:59.380
...you have a yukata,
food booths, even a play...

02:59.550 --> 03:00.600
A festival...

03:00.750 --> 03:02.270
When I think about a festival...

03:03.350 --> 03:05.110
...it just has to be scoring with a girl.

03:07.020 --> 03:08.950
When you talk about a festival...

03:09.020 --> 03:10.320
...isn't it about booze?

03:10.390 --> 03:12.410
Everyone drinks to their
hearts content until late at night!

03:13.190 --> 03:14.220
Mom...

03:14.560 --> 03:16.830
It doesn't matter who you are tonight!
Let's have a grand party!

03:16.830 --> 03:17.590
Just kidding!

03:17.700 --> 03:19.930
Today, can you not get drunk for once?

03:20.000 --> 03:21.530
Eh? Why?

03:21.530 --> 03:24.840
We're having a festival after all... What am I
going to do if I don't get drunk?

03:24.840 --> 03:26.460
There are other things that you can do.

03:37.750 --> 03:38.810
Oh, over there!

03:41.050 --> 03:43.420
Welcome, welcome!

03:43.520 --> 03:44.750
Gramps, go to it!

04:03.380 --> 04:05.440
Here's your manda candy!
Thanks for your patronage!

04:05.510 --> 04:07.000
Toposte! Elder!

04:08.010 --> 04:09.120
Oh, Haré!

04:09.120 --> 04:10.980
Want to buy a manda candy? It's delicious!

04:11.280 --> 04:13.440
Not now. It's almost time.

04:13.520 --> 04:14.850
Everyone's gathered around already.

04:14.920 --> 04:16.390
Oh, that's right. I forgot.

04:16.660 --> 04:18.020
You too, Elder. Hurry up.

04:18.020 --> 04:19.350
Sorry, sorry.

04:19.990 --> 04:20.750
Hurry!

04:20.860 --> 04:21.850
Y-Yes!

04:39.680 --> 04:43.050
When can we get rid of them already?

04:43.550 --> 04:46.520
Sir, they've gathered much strength lately.

04:46.850 --> 04:50.410
At this rate, they will become
a problem that hinders our grand plan.

04:51.560 --> 04:55.550
Please rest assured, we have already
thought of a new plan.

04:56.060 --> 04:59.620
We have failed until now because we were
trying to crush them.

05:00.030 --> 05:03.060
From now on, it's time for us to use our
brains, Boa-sama.

05:03.240 --> 05:04.600
Please, take a look at this.

05:08.010 --> 05:10.740
This is the Scarlet Ranger's weakness.

05:12.880 --> 05:13.900
I see.

05:14.150 --> 05:15.940
Marie's birthday...

05:16.020 --> 05:17.510
How old is she now?

05:17.650 --> 05:18.480
Ten.

05:18.580 --> 05:21.180
Then, we all have to celebrate,
with a party or something.

05:21.350 --> 05:25.350
If there isn't cutlet curry there, I'm not going!

05:25.690 --> 05:28.820
You really love cutlet curry...
It suits you so well.

05:28.930 --> 05:29.860
Shut up.

05:31.030 --> 05:32.550
Guys! We have a huge problem!

05:32.800 --> 05:34.630
This is for the Five-Man Sentai.

05:34.830 --> 05:37.630
I have abducted Marie,
the Scarlet Ranger's younger sister.

05:37.700 --> 05:41.660
If you want her returned alive,
everyone must leave their
transformation headbands behind.

05:44.340 --> 05:45.670
That damn Boa Group!

05:50.320 --> 05:52.910
This is where they specified.

05:53.050 --> 05:54.580
What's that!?

05:56.560 --> 05:58.580
So, you've come, Five-Man Sentai.

05:58.660 --> 06:00.490
Where is Marie!? She better be all right!

06:00.590 --> 06:03.590
Why don't you worry
about your own safety first?

06:07.830 --> 06:09.660
Do away with them, Pock'rs!

06:09.740 --> 06:10.900
Poku!

06:20.180 --> 06:22.740
We won't last long at this rate!
We have to transform after all...

06:22.850 --> 06:24.780
But, our transformation headbands...

06:24.850 --> 06:26.010
Scarlet Ranger!

06:27.750 --> 06:31.780
This is the detonator for a bomb planted
right next to your younger sister!

06:31.890 --> 06:32.550
What!?

06:32.630 --> 06:35.920
If you value your sister's life, I suggest you
stand there and be defeated by the Pock'rs!

06:36.000 --> 06:36.550
Poku!

06:36.630 --> 06:37.460
Cheater!

06:37.800 --> 06:39.890
This is the day that you all shall die!

06:41.430 --> 06:42.570
Marie is all right.

06:42.570 --> 06:45.000
She's being tended to
by the Master right about now.

06:45.100 --> 06:45.900
What!?

06:46.210 --> 06:47.830
But, before that, we need to transform!

06:47.940 --> 06:48.430
Yeah!

06:48.510 --> 06:49.600
Let's go, guys!

06:54.280 --> 06:55.180
Scarlet Ranger!

06:55.350 --> 06:56.080
Indigo Ranger!

06:56.250 --> 06:57.080
Forest Green Ranger!

06:57.220 --> 06:58.240
Violet Blue Ranger!

06:58.420 --> 06:59.350
Ocher Ranger!

06:59.750 --> 07:02.150
The Lethal Mid-range Color Five-man Sentai!

07:02.320 --> 07:04.260
Go, Evil Dragon Pokuhn!

07:04.260 --> 07:06.750
Poku!

07:07.630 --> 07:08.690
Here. Take this.

07:08.690 --> 07:10.030
Uh, what was it...

07:11.260 --> 07:15.530
I thought something like this might happen,
so I developed new weapons. Use these.

07:15.630 --> 07:17.070
T-Thanks, Professor.

07:17.800 --> 07:19.170
Guys, let's use these!

07:19.240 --> 07:19.900
Yeah!

07:20.110 --> 07:20.660
Lethal...

07:20.740 --> 07:21.210
Lethal...

07:21.270 --> 07:21.760
Ultimate...

07:21.840 --> 07:22.510
Ultimate...

07:22.510 --> 07:22.870
...Attack!

07:22.940 --> 07:23.600
...Attack!

07:29.080 --> 07:30.310
Poku!

07:31.250 --> 07:34.120
Just you wait,
Lethal Mid-Range Color Five-man Sentai!

07:35.620 --> 07:36.920
The battle is over...

07:37.090 --> 07:40.890
But as long as evil resides,
there is no time of peace for us!

07:41.590 --> 07:47.000
And so, this ends the
Lethal Mid-Range Color Five-Man Sentai
play, staged entirely by volunteers.

07:47.100 --> 07:48.660
Thank you for watching!

07:50.900 --> 07:52.560
Whew! It's over, it's over.

07:53.770 --> 07:55.260
By the way, are you free tonight?

07:55.340 --> 07:55.860
Eh?

07:56.180 --> 07:58.610
If you don't mind, would you like to go
drinking with me after this?

07:58.680 --> 07:59.840
Mom! This guy...

08:02.480 --> 08:03.380
Drinks are on me!

08:03.450 --> 08:05.420
Doctor, I thought you didn't drink.

08:05.520 --> 08:08.110
It's all right,
you can drink my share as well, Weda.

08:09.860 --> 08:10.580
Uighur?

08:13.890 --> 08:14.730
Don't be joking around!

08:14.730 --> 08:15.190
Huh?

08:16.200 --> 08:18.890
Why am I the one in a full-body animal suit!?

08:19.130 --> 08:21.190
Eh? But, Uighur,
you're the one that volunteered...

08:21.930 --> 08:24.670
If you guys are all my friends, can't you be
more sympathetic?!

08:24.670 --> 08:26.500
You know how I feel, don't you!?

08:26.770 --> 08:29.880
Come to think of it,
Uighur was in love with Weda...

08:29.880 --> 08:30.860
W-We're sorry.

08:31.780 --> 08:36.540
I'm an ineffectual character
who doesn't make any impression
whatsoever on anyone after all.

08:36.850 --> 08:41.450
I only had one line,
no real showy scene. Just an extra.

08:42.090 --> 08:45.750
My life has no place
in the glimmering spotlight.

08:45.820 --> 08:47.880
Really? You're sure in the spotlight now.

08:48.190 --> 08:52.760
Guys, I want all of you to watch
my first and last big moment.

08:54.130 --> 08:55.660
That's your big moment!?

08:56.040 --> 08:57.400
You're glimmering, Uighur.

08:57.470 --> 08:59.270
Don't glimmer like that!!

08:59.340 --> 09:00.810
Stop him, Guu!

09:00.870 --> 09:02.810
Stop him? Are you trying to ruin the play?

09:02.880 --> 09:03.930
This is not a play!

09:04.010 --> 09:04.740
You're nit-picking.

09:04.810 --> 09:05.780
I don't care, just stop it!

09:10.050 --> 09:10.720
He stopped.

09:10.720 --> 09:12.680
Did I tell you to stop his life!?

09:12.750 --> 09:13.750
What's the meaning of this, Guu?
Are you all right?

09:13.750 --> 09:14.220
What's the meaning of this, Guu?

09:14.290 --> 09:15.880
It's an American joke!

09:15.950 --> 09:17.480
There can't be any
dangerous jokes like that...

09:17.560 --> 09:19.120
Good boys and girls shouldn't
try this at home.

09:19.120 --> 09:19.220
If you know that, don't do it!

09:19.220 --> 09:20.460
If you know that, don't do it!
I'm sorry I didn't realize it.

09:20.460 --> 09:20.590
I'm sorry I didn't realize it.

09:20.590 --> 09:21.030
It was a gag that risked his life.
I'm sorry I didn't realize it.

09:21.030 --> 09:21.090
It was a gag that risked his life.

09:21.090 --> 09:21.790
It was a gag that risked his life.
Next time,
we'll put you in the spotlight, Uighur.

09:21.790 --> 09:21.860
Next time,
we'll put you in the spotlight, Uighur.

09:21.860 --> 09:23.130
Risk your own life!
Next time,
we'll put you in the spotlight, Uighur.

09:23.130 --> 09:23.200
Risk your own life!

09:23.200 --> 09:23.430
Risk your own life!
Yeah. How about
we make Uighur play a prince?

09:23.430 --> 09:25.000
Yeah. How about
we make Uighur play a prince?

09:25.000 --> 09:25.900
What about it?
Yeah. How about
we make Uighur play a prince?

09:25.900 --> 09:25.960
Yeah. How about
we make Uighur play a prince?

09:25.960 --> 09:26.130
Forget about it.
Yeah. How about
we make Uighur play a prince?

09:26.130 --> 09:26.500
Forget about it.

09:26.570 --> 09:26.770
I can't do that!

09:26.770 --> 09:27.560
I can't do that!
Guys...

09:28.130 --> 09:29.070
So, let's go.

09:29.130 --> 09:31.470
Doctor, you're so assertive.

09:31.540 --> 09:36.980
Wait, do I make even less of an impression
than an idol singing in the corner of the
screen during a swimming pool special?

09:37.210 --> 09:39.470
If the school doctor is that annoying,
you just have to defeat him.

09:39.980 --> 09:42.570
Your own happiness
is something you grasp for yourself.

09:42.650 --> 09:43.840
Don't encourage him!

09:48.020 --> 09:49.250
I challenge you, school doctor!

09:49.320 --> 09:51.520
S-Stop it! This isn't a duel!

09:52.390 --> 09:55.380
I'm not seeking nor accepting any
challenges.

09:55.560 --> 09:59.330
Even if I win the challenge, I don't get
anything out of it. Sorry. I pass.

09:59.700 --> 10:00.560
Are you running away?

10:00.630 --> 10:02.290
I'm saying, I don't like stuff like that.

10:02.740 --> 10:04.330
So you are going to run away!

10:04.400 --> 10:06.030
Shut up, or I'll give you a shot!

10:06.610 --> 10:07.470
Stop!

10:08.740 --> 10:11.210
Bloodshed must not happen in a battle.

10:11.440 --> 10:13.570
That is the rule of this village!

10:18.080 --> 10:22.650
An argument must be settled by
using a ritual that has been handed
down from long ago.

10:22.790 --> 10:24.090
Understand?

10:27.790 --> 10:32.730
The last time that this ritual
was performed, I was only 5 years old.

10:33.130 --> 10:35.860
Since then, this door has never been opened.

10:35.970 --> 10:38.370
Match your wits, not your swords.

10:38.440 --> 10:40.840
Pride yourself on speed, not strength.

10:43.810 --> 10:46.180
That is the essence of this ritual.

10:48.310 --> 10:49.910
Well then, that's that.

10:50.050 --> 10:51.110
You can have Weda.

10:51.180 --> 10:51.620
Eh?

10:51.850 --> 10:53.980
If you win this match, you can have Weda.

10:54.890 --> 10:57.260
Come on,
a person is not a thing to give away.

10:57.260 --> 10:58.690
T-That's right.

10:58.760 --> 10:59.950
Then, one year's worth.

11:00.030 --> 11:01.190
One year's worth?

11:01.390 --> 11:03.360
Mm... One year's worth, huh...

11:03.460 --> 11:05.900
Eh? Why are you beginning to agree?

11:06.060 --> 11:08.700
Hey, Guu. I want Weda, too.

11:08.700 --> 11:10.000
Can I participate in this competition?

11:10.070 --> 11:12.200
What? Even you Marie?
Why do you want her?

11:12.270 --> 11:15.260
Mom, this is about you.
Why don't you say something about it?

11:15.370 --> 11:17.970
Mm... Mom's so popular!

11:18.110 --> 11:21.100
So, stop fighting over me, please!

11:21.180 --> 11:22.440
Like that?

11:24.250 --> 11:25.310
This is no good...

11:25.580 --> 11:27.610
In any case, I won't allow anything like a
year's worth of Mom!

11:27.720 --> 11:29.490
No, no, no, no, no, no, no, no!

11:29.490 --> 11:30.390
All of you, NO!

11:30.390 --> 11:31.050
Shut up.

11:31.790 --> 11:32.720
I allow it.

11:32.790 --> 11:35.230
Hurray! All right!

11:35.890 --> 11:39.490
And now,
we'll start the first ever Weda Challenge!

11:39.570 --> 11:41.330
Wait, there's going to be
a second one and a third one!?

11:41.500 --> 11:43.590
The three contestants are,
from the right, Uighur...

11:43.900 --> 11:44.530
...Marie...

11:44.870 --> 11:46.700
...and the school doctor.

11:47.110 --> 11:50.470
The winner will receive one year's worth of
Weda as the prize!

11:50.710 --> 11:53.340
Yeah! I'm the winner's prize!

11:54.650 --> 11:55.510
Mom...

11:55.580 --> 11:58.480
Now, we'll hear how revved up the
contestants are!

11:58.750 --> 11:59.840
All right!

12:00.290 --> 12:04.920
I-I-I will do my best and make sure to win, so
I would like to be happy with Weda!

12:05.960 --> 12:09.420
If you're fine with an old woman like me, then
I would like to be happy!

12:09.600 --> 12:12.860
I will make a happy future for Weda!

12:13.000 --> 12:15.330
Let's stay a happy married couple that
always acts like lovers!

12:15.630 --> 12:18.470
Why am I not in that picture of a happy
future!?

12:18.600 --> 12:21.270
Um, I would like to take a bath with Weda...

12:21.270 --> 12:24.040
...and sleep next to her, and go shopping
with her...

12:24.040 --> 12:28.140
...and get good morning and good night
kisses!

12:28.850 --> 12:30.410
Oh, that sounds like fun.

12:31.720 --> 12:33.120
And, lastly, Clive-san.

12:33.120 --> 12:34.710
Oh, I have to speak too?

12:34.850 --> 12:36.120
The problem is him!

12:37.690 --> 12:39.680
You know, after coming this far...

12:39.990 --> 12:46.200
I have to say that it's not like me to go
though so much trouble for a girl-
for Weda-chan, or anyone else.

12:46.200 --> 12:49.030
So then, instead of Weda-chan for a year...

12:50.370 --> 12:52.500
I'm fine with just one night.

12:52.500 --> 12:53.810
So, I'm going to drop out of the race.

12:53.810 --> 12:55.430
So, are you free tonight?

12:56.780 --> 12:58.510
I won't allow such exceptions!

12:58.510 --> 12:59.880
Eh? So stingy!

12:59.950 --> 13:01.470
You are not allowed to retire.

13:01.580 --> 13:05.350
Oh no! I don't mind the other two, but
absolutely not the school doctor!

13:05.550 --> 13:06.610
Just a minute!

13:06.890 --> 13:08.910
Hey, I want to participate.

13:11.860 --> 13:12.790
That's fine...

13:13.190 --> 13:16.290
What is this smile on Guu's face,
as if she was waiting for me to jump in?

13:17.100 --> 13:19.620
Well, we have a new entry.

13:19.700 --> 13:23.000
It's Haré.
He'll be joining the competition now.

13:24.400 --> 13:25.340
Really?

13:25.870 --> 13:29.930
I don't mind the other two, but I will not give
Mom to you no matter what!

13:30.310 --> 13:33.770
I never asked you if I could have her,
but hearing you say you're not going
to give her to me is irritating.

13:35.910 --> 13:40.150
The competition will be
decided by the total points
that each contestant gains in each round.

13:40.220 --> 13:44.210
Gupta will provide commentary,
and the chief referee will be the elder.

13:44.290 --> 13:45.590
My regards.

13:45.660 --> 13:46.590
Me, too.

13:46.860 --> 13:50.730
Now, Round 1 will test your
knowledge of the prize, Weda.

13:50.960 --> 13:54.130
Each contestant will give information
concerning Weda.

13:54.130 --> 13:57.400
If the information is correct, the contestant
will earn 1 point for each correct fact.

13:58.200 --> 14:00.870
I've got the most advantage
because I live with her.

14:01.810 --> 14:04.470
Could it be that Guu rigged it
so that it; s easy for me to win?

14:06.310 --> 14:09.300
Thanks a lot, Guu! I'll do my best!

14:09.610 --> 14:13.020
25 years old. Hobbies are drinking,
net-surfing, reading, and mail-ordering.

14:13.020 --> 14:16.190
Her shoe size is 25. She's 168 cm tall.

14:16.190 --> 14:18.320
Her favorite foods are
dried squid and corn-nuts.

14:18.460 --> 14:20.160
Her favorite phrase is,
"Something unexpected."

14:20.160 --> 14:22.150
All right, this will get me 10 points.

14:22.330 --> 14:25.730
For example... 25 years old.
Hobbies are drinking, net-surfing,
reading, and mail-ordering.

14:25.730 --> 14:29.570
Her shoe size is 25. She's 168 cm tall. Her
favorite foods are dried squid and corn-nuts.

14:29.570 --> 14:31.200
Her favorite phrase is,
"Something unexpected."

14:31.200 --> 14:33.400
This will get you 10 points.

14:33.470 --> 14:36.240
Please make sure your answers are
different from the examples I just gave.

14:37.710 --> 14:39.340
Was that a coincidence?

14:39.410 --> 14:41.070
No, in her case...

14:41.180 --> 14:42.610
Now, please answer.

14:43.820 --> 14:44.910
Yes, Uighur-san?

14:45.180 --> 14:47.720
Well, she's kind...

14:47.720 --> 14:53.130
...frail, gentle, beautiful,
pretty, mischievous, cute, frail...

14:53.130 --> 14:54.390
...everyone just wants to hug her, frail...

14:54.390 --> 14:56.430
Personal fantasies are not allowed.
...everyone just wants to hug her, frail...

14:56.430 --> 14:57.260
Fantasies...

14:57.330 --> 14:58.390
Anyone else have anything?

14:58.860 --> 15:02.660
She's 35-22-35 from the top.

15:02.730 --> 15:04.900
Oh, those are my three sizes,
right on the dot.

15:05.000 --> 15:06.910
The school doctor earns 3 points.

15:06.910 --> 15:08.430
Why do you know such a thing!?

15:08.540 --> 15:10.200
Well, you know, I'm a doctor.

15:10.280 --> 15:11.400
That has nothing to do with it!

15:11.680 --> 15:14.740
If I recall Weda is a girl from a good family.

15:15.410 --> 15:19.010
She's the youngest child, and used to be
frail, but she was loved by her family.

15:19.380 --> 15:22.550
Her measurements 11 years ago, as well as
her height, weight, and shoe size, were...

15:22.550 --> 15:25.420
Why do you know so much?
And, 11 years ago while we're at it?
Her measurements 11 years ago, as well as
her height, weight, and shoe size, were...

15:25.590 --> 15:28.590
The school doctor gains 17 points,
for a total of 20 points.

15:28.590 --> 15:29.800
Wait a minute!

15:29.800 --> 15:33.060
There; s no way to confirm things
from 11 years ago, so don't count them
as part of his points!

15:33.330 --> 15:34.360
I've confirmed them.

15:34.700 --> 15:35.770
Oh?

15:35.770 --> 15:39.830
When and how did you make the
confirmations? I would definitely
like to hear this, huh?

15:40.470 --> 15:41.310
When?

15:41.310 --> 15:43.640
What year, month, day, hour, minute, and
second?

15:50.920 --> 15:52.750
We'll head to round 2.

15:52.880 --> 15:55.010
I'll call this, "Woo her with your words."

15:55.290 --> 15:59.380
Whisper romantic words to Weda, and leave
her weak in the knees.

15:59.560 --> 16:02.720
What kind of words do you think would be
effective here, Gupta-san?

16:02.860 --> 16:04.230
Let's see...

16:04.330 --> 16:09.770
Something like, "If I can have you, I don't
want anything else in this world."

16:09.840 --> 16:10.800
...or the like?

16:10.870 --> 16:13.000
Out of 100 points, how many would that be?

16:13.070 --> 16:13.770
2 points.

16:13.910 --> 16:14.940
What's up with that!?

16:14.940 --> 16:17.500
Your heart wasn't in it. Your heart.

16:17.580 --> 16:21.570
Of course not! I didn't want to say such an
embarrassing phrase to begin with!

16:22.380 --> 16:24.250
Okay! I'll go first!

16:24.320 --> 16:24.610
Go ahead.

16:24.680 --> 16:31.050
You know, if I were to have Weda for a year, I
would make cute clothes each and every day,
and dress her up.

16:31.220 --> 16:34.020
And, the two of us will be
very wonderful and fashionable!

16:35.330 --> 16:36.850
89 points.

16:37.030 --> 16:39.220
Marie has started off with a high score!

16:39.900 --> 16:41.990
Okay, I'll go now!

16:42.070 --> 16:42.590
Go ahead.

16:42.770 --> 16:48.070
I'm confident that I can do any cooking,
cleaning, and laundry job if it's for Weda.

16:48.770 --> 16:49.640
60 points.

16:49.770 --> 16:52.000
Eh? Such a low score?

16:52.110 --> 16:57.240
It's nice that you'd do everything for me,
but as long as we're together, I would like us
to help each other out...

16:57.520 --> 16:59.610
So that doesn't apply to your son? Your son?

17:00.990 --> 17:03.780
What? Is he really thinking about this
seriously?

17:04.160 --> 17:06.280
Huh! He can't possibly be serious about
Mom...

17:06.790 --> 17:10.200
Well, Weda-chan, you were such a shy girl in
the past...

17:10.200 --> 17:13.630
...but now you're such a go-go girl.
I was so surprised!

17:13.730 --> 17:15.470
But...

17:15.470 --> 17:17.560
This is good in its own way.

17:17.900 --> 17:20.570
From a serious face to
a perverted one in an instant!?

17:20.810 --> 17:24.400
That means, I guess
I should get serious about this.

17:24.810 --> 17:26.940
And back to a serious face again?

17:27.450 --> 17:29.310
Then, I'll go next.

17:29.450 --> 17:30.040
Go ahead.

17:30.150 --> 17:31.840
Um, just a moment, Host-san.

17:31.950 --> 17:32.510
Hm?

17:32.580 --> 17:35.320
I want to say... mumble mumble...

17:35.320 --> 17:38.220
...but is that all right?

17:38.290 --> 17:41.450
Unfortunately,
that's against the broadcast rules.

17:41.530 --> 17:43.460
What, what was he going to say?

17:43.800 --> 17:45.460
I can't say it in front of children, right?

17:45.530 --> 17:46.500
Right.

17:46.570 --> 17:49.000
Why are the two of them
so chummy all of a sudden?

17:49.100 --> 17:50.190
Oh, well.

17:51.200 --> 17:52.640
I'll make you a happy woman.

17:52.740 --> 17:54.140
Thanks, doctor.

17:54.140 --> 17:55.300
76 points.

17:55.370 --> 17:57.670
Now, up last is Haré. Go ahead!

17:58.040 --> 17:59.340
Uh... Mom.

17:59.950 --> 18:02.000
Well, um...

18:03.080 --> 18:04.010
Tonight...

18:04.080 --> 18:05.310
What is it?

18:06.020 --> 18:08.210
I won't stop you
even if you drink lots of booze.

18:09.960 --> 18:11.420
120 points!

18:11.590 --> 18:16.220
Oh, we have a flag! The elder has asked if
this counts as bribery.

18:16.290 --> 18:18.190
We'll discuss this privately.

18:19.200 --> 18:20.530
Why is that!?

18:26.300 --> 18:28.040
A decision has been reached.

18:28.040 --> 18:29.010
The verdict is...

18:29.610 --> 18:30.510
Okay.

18:31.780 --> 18:36.010
Since Haré is not actually earning a living,
it's been decided that this doesn't count as
bribery.

18:36.410 --> 18:40.440
Currently, Haré is in the lead with 120 points.
Now for the final round...

18:40.590 --> 18:46.110
To keep her for an entire year, you'll need a
tough mind and body.

18:46.190 --> 18:49.590
So, the last battle will be a challenge of
stamina - a race once around the jungle.

18:49.790 --> 18:51.320
Now, on your marks...

18:51.630 --> 18:54.530
All right, I'm good at running, so I can be
second place at worst.

18:54.600 --> 18:55.590
I'll take this competition!

18:55.730 --> 18:57.030
Ready...

19:00.540 --> 19:01.530
What did you just hide?

19:01.610 --> 19:02.500
Nothing.

19:02.570 --> 19:04.040
You were trying to do something.

19:04.180 --> 19:04.870
Nothing major.

19:04.940 --> 19:06.810
What? What are you going to do?

19:06.910 --> 19:09.750
Well, you seem to have stamina
if nothing else...

19:09.750 --> 19:11.680
...so I thought I'd stop you
in your tracks for a while.

19:11.850 --> 19:13.750
Don't be so nonchalant with your
explanation.

19:13.820 --> 19:18.720
I hate macho competitions like this, so it's
better off for me to sabotage my competition.

19:18.820 --> 19:21.050
I see, something like a little handicap.

19:21.130 --> 19:22.350
What are you authorizing this for?
This is obviously against the rules!

19:22.430 --> 19:23.090
Go!

19:25.500 --> 19:27.560
What's with that sudden start?
Don't you care!?

19:27.630 --> 19:29.070
Forget about it. Run.

19:33.140 --> 19:37.040
I won't let someone crazy, mad, and
dangerous like you have my mom!

19:37.110 --> 19:41.480
Do you understand that half of you is made
up of those dangerous genes?

19:41.550 --> 19:43.570
No, I don't have even 1 gram
of that in my body!

19:43.650 --> 19:45.120
Don't be so un-scientific about it!

19:45.180 --> 19:46.650
When I say I have nothing to do with it,
I have nothing to do with it!

19:46.720 --> 19:48.350
How about you give way to your father?

19:48.420 --> 19:50.390
Someone like you isn't my dad!

19:52.790 --> 19:54.490
I thought you didn't like
macho competitions!?

19:54.490 --> 19:55.530
I was just playing along with you!
I thought you didn't like
macho competitions!?

19:55.530 --> 19:55.990
I was just playing along with you!

19:56.060 --> 19:57.690
You are the worst selfish guy!

19:57.760 --> 19:58.890
You're damn conceited!

19:59.230 --> 20:00.290
You' re getting in my way!

20:00.370 --> 20:01.460
That's my line!

20:02.400 --> 20:03.700
Idiot! Idiot, idiot idiot!!

20:03.770 --> 20:05.170
Stupid, stupid!

20:07.140 --> 20:08.740
Only 50 meters left.

20:08.740 --> 20:10.210
Which one will win!?

20:11.310 --> 20:12.440
You are the one person...

20:12.580 --> 20:13.600
...I won't lose against!

20:36.300 --> 20:38.030
Winner: Haré!

20:52.350 --> 20:54.080
That festival was fun!

20:54.150 --> 20:56.990
The food booths, the play,
the competition, and the booze!

21:01.590 --> 21:03.650
Yup. There sure was a lot going on.

21:06.330 --> 21:08.170
Come to think of it...

21:08.170 --> 21:11.070
In my case, winning the competition meant
that life went on as usual.

21:11.070 --> 21:12.730
Nothing changed at all.

21:16.510 --> 21:19.840
Hey! Let me drink more! Keep your promise!

21:19.910 --> 21:21.900
Actually, it's gotten worse.

21:22.510 --> 21:24.850
Time for the second round?

21:24.920 --> 21:25.540
No way!!

22:36.440 --> 22:37.080
NEXT EPISODE

22:37.080 --> 22:38.610
Eh? Someone came from the city?

22:38.610 --> 22:39.510
Two of them, in fact?

22:39.510 --> 22:40.980
I see... I wonder what they're like.

22:40.980 --> 22:43.020
But what do they want in a jungle like this?

22:43.020 --> 22:44.850
Wait, a coat in this perpetually hot jungle!?

22:44.850 --> 22:46.520
And the other one has
a really scary look in his eyes.

22:46.520 --> 22:47.320
And the other one has
a really scary look in his eyes.

22:47.420 --> 22:49.060
Suspicious... Very suspicious.

22:49.060 --> 22:50.890
Are you sure that you two
are showing up in the right anime?

22:51.060 --> 22:52.490
Do you guys know the school doctor?

22:52.490 --> 22:54.360
They say that similar
types of people flock together.

22:54.360 --> 22:57.260
Hm? What? You're asking if there's a big box
around here?

22:57.260 --> 22:58.800
What in the world are you going to use it for?

22:58.800 --> 23:00.500
Eh? You said a box...

23:00.500 --> 23:01.000
There's a casket, but is that okay?

23:01.000 --> 23:01.730
There's a casket, but is that okay?

23:01.730 --> 23:02.070
Next episode of Haré+Guu: A Big Box

23:02.070 --> 23:05.440
A Big Box
